[I] Documentation tool for Lua

[T] LDoc is a documentation tool for Lua that generates HTML or Markdown
[T] documentation from comments in Lua and C source files. It is compatible
[T] with LuaDoc markup and depends on the Penlight library.

[U] https://github.com/lunarmodules/LDoc

